---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../lib/site";
---

<Base title="Privacy policy" description="How Udan Tours and Travels collects, uses and protects your information on the website, in your Udan account and in the Udan connector for Claude.">
  <section class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 md:px-6 md:py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-udan-charcoal md:text-4xl">Privacy policy</h1>
    <div class="prose-udan mt-6">
      <p>Last updated: 18 November 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        Udan Tours and Travels ("Udan", "we", "us") is a travel agency in Vadodara, Gujarat, India, established 1997. This policy covers our website (udantravelsbdq.com), your Udan account (app.udantravelsbdq.com), our emails, and the Udan connector for Claude (mcp.udantravelsbdq.com).
      </p>

      <h2>2. What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Account details:</strong> your email address (this is your Udan account), and your name, phone number, country, time zone and preferred currency if you give them.</li>
        <li><strong>Trip details:</strong> destinations, dates, number and ages of travellers, hotel preferences, budget, itinerary notes, and any price or screenshot from another booking site that you send us.</li>
        <li><strong>Booking details:</strong> the quotes we send you, whether you accept them, payments we record against them, and travel documents such as vouchers, tickets and visas that we upload to your account.</li>
        <li><strong>Sign-in:</strong> if you sign in with Google, Google tells us your email address and name. We do not receive your Google password.</li>
        <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> the cookies needed to keep you signed in to your account, and standard server logs (IP address, browser, pages requested) kept by our hosting providers for security.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not collect card or bank details on our website, in your account or through Claude. When you pay, you pay by bank transfer, UPI, cash at our office, or through a payment link from our payment provider, and they handle your card details.</p>

      <h2>3. How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To price your trip, send you quotes, and arrange and book your travel.</li>
        <li>To email you about your requests and bookings, and, only if you switch them on, to send WhatsApp or SMS alerts.</li>
        <li>To keep records we are required to keep, and to improve how we price trips. Prices from our past quotes may be combined into typical price ranges that we publish; these never identify you.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell your information, and we do not send marketing emails unless you ask us to.</p>

      <h2>4. Who we share it with</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Travel suppliers</strong> (hotels, airlines, transport and tour operators, insurers, visa processors) when needed to book your trip.</li>
        <li><strong>Service providers</strong> who run parts of our systems for us: Supabase (database, sign-in and file storage), Resend (sending email), Vercel and Cloudflare (hosting the account and the Claude connector), GitHub (hosting this website), and Google (if you choose Google sign-in).</li>
        <li><strong>Claude, by Anthropic</strong>, only when you connect the Udan connector and use it: the information you ask about is returned to your Claude conversation. Anthropic's handling of your conversations is covered by its own privacy policy.</li>
        <li><strong>Authorities</strong> when the law requires it, for example for visa applications or tax records.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>We keep your account and booking records for as long as you have an account with us and as long as the law requires for travel and tax records. You can ask us to delete your account at any time; we will delete what we are not required to keep.</p>

      <h2>6. Your choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>See and correct your details in your Udan account, or ask us for a copy of everything we hold about you.</li>
        <li>Ask us to delete your account and data.</li>
        <li>Turn WhatsApp and SMS alerts on or off in your account settings.</li>
        <li>Disconnect the Udan connector in Claude at any time.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>7. Security</h2>
      <p>Your account data is protected by sign-in and by access rules that let each customer see only their own quotes. Travel documents are stored privately and shared through short-lived links. No system is perfectly secure, so please tell us at once if you notice anything wrong with your account.</p>

      <h2>8. Changes</h2>
      <p>If we change this policy, we will update the date above and, for important changes, tell you by email.</p>

      <h2>9. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        {SITE.name}<br />
        {SITE.address.lines.map((l) => <>{l}<br /></>)}
        Email: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a><br />
        Phone: <a href={`tel:${SITE.phones[1].tel}`}>{SITE.phones[1].display}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
